      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Over the course of 1 minute, the shermshroom can apply a restorative salve of mycelium to a creature within its reach. The creature regains 9 (2d8) Hit Points or loses the Poisoned condition (shermshroom's choice). Once the shermshroom has applied this salve, it can't do so again until it spends 1 hour preparing a new one.</p>",
