      "flags": {},
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The shermshroom rings its bell and sings a song, releasing a cloud of faint spores in a 30-foot Emanation originating from the shermshroom, which lasts until the start of its next turn. When it uses this action, the shermshroom chooses one of the following songs, which determine the effect of the spores:</p><ul><li><strong>Song of Clarity.</strong> Allies within the area are Immune to the Charmed and Frightened conditions. Any existing effect causing an ally to be Charmed or Frightened is suppressed on the ally while in the area.</li><li><strong>Song of Energy.</strong> Any ally that starts its turn within the area has its Speed increased by 5 feet until the end of its turn.</li><li><strong>Song of Light.</strong> The area is filled with Dim Light.</li><li><strong>Song of Vigor.</strong> Any Bloodied ally that starts its turn within the area regains 1 Hit Point.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
